# WP-FAR-12 (owner 10-20 scope decision: people far away = skeletal LOD -> anim budget -> baked crowd beyond).
# UE 5.5 AnimToTexture (City Sample / Mass crowds): beyond skeletal range a figure plays a baked vertex animation,
# no skeleton evaluated on the CPU. Here: VertexAnimationCrowd bakes the clip x the lowest skinned level into the
# skin cache's stream layout (30 fps); a record at its lowest level and below screen size 0.03 (the WP-FAR-10
# FOV-aware metric; back above 0.04) is drawn from its baked frame, the animation only runs its clock
# (SkinnedLodFeedback::Vat / VatClock), the skin cache skips it.
# Readout: editor.log "[Crowd] skeletal N, vat M, draws D, anim CPU X ms" and "[Crowd] baked clip ...".
# Scene: CesiumMan at the origin + 199 copies spread 30-600 m behind it (WP_FAR12_SkinnedCrowd).
# "before": Quality ViewDistance Cinematic resolves MeshLOD off = every figure skeletal LOD 0, every frame.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_FAR12_SkinnedCrowd.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance High"
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 90
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Когда advance 2
Тогда far12_near CesiumMan at 5 m walking, skeletal; log: [Crowd] skeletal > 0 (the near figures), vat = the far ones
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,15000
Когда advance 2
Тогда far12_mid at 150 m the far figures are VAT and walking (legs apart, not frozen, no T-pose), no pop against LOD 6; log: [Crowd] vat > 0
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 10
Когда advance 2
Тогда far12_zoom FOV 10 at 150 m: the zoomed figures are large and skeletal again; log: [Crowd] skeletal grows, vat shrinks
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 90
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,60000
Когда advance 2
Тогда far12_far at 600 m every figure is VAT; log: [Crowd] skeletal 0, vat 200, anim CPU ms below the near frame's
Когда run Quality "Quality: ViewDistance Cinematic"
Когда advance 2
Тогда far12_far_before the same 600 m view with LOD off (Cinematic): log: [Crowd] skeletal 200, vat 0; anim CPU ms = the cost before this change
Когда run Action "Stop"
